			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1507,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Simplify payload construction and comment formatting for Webview effects\n\nRefactor the JSON payload creation logic in `Source/Track/Effect/CreateEffectForRequest/Webview.rs` to remove redundant line breaks and formatting inconsistencies in comments and string insertions. Align the implementation with the existing strategy of preserving positional `args` while adding named aliases for specific IPC methods like `registerView`, `unregisterView`, and `create`.\n\nThe changes streamline the code structure without altering the functional behavior, ensuring the `viewId`, `viewType`, and `title` named keys are correctly mapped from the positional arguments array for SkyBridge consumption.",
			"SHA": "a81efd6d80b95fe80e345ffda5820827bf96120b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-04T10:40:48Z",
